# Issue #3194 (greenfield flag day): each document update signs and sends the
# operations it depends on as a required `dependencyVersionVector`, so every
# request that embeds an outgoing update or a rotation baseline gains a
# required property. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains
# the new contract.
POST /auth/register added the new required request property `initialOrganizationMetadataContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/dependencyVersionVector` (shared schema: `DocumentCreateSeedRequest`, also at `initialRosterProfileContainer/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/dependencyVersionVector`, `initialSystemContainers/items/initialMetadataSync/outgoingUpdates/items/dependencyVersionVector` and 3 more)

