# Issue #3194 (greenfield flag day): the server refuses a sync whose update
# depends on an uncommitted operation with 409
# `document_sync_dependency_uncommitted`. Every document mutation code enum
# shares the sync codes, so each operation that advertises them gains the
# value. Remove these exact diagnostics as soon as main contains the new
# contract.
POST /containers added the new `document_sync_dependency_uncommitted` enum value to the `anyOf[subschema #1]/code/anyOf[#/components/schemas/DocumentMutationErrorCode]/anyOf[subschema #2]/` response property for the response status `409`

